<title>USA: Boatmen's holders approve NationsBank deal.</title>
<headline>Boatmen's holders approve NationsBank deal.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS, Mo. 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Boatmen's Bancshares Inc said shareholders at a special meeting on Friday approved a proposed merger with NationsBank Corp with about 98 percent in favor of the $9-billion-plus transaction.</p>
</text>
